msgstr "विजेटको प्रकार (वर्ग) फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:375
msgid ""
"Makes the widget editable or read only, depending on the editable argument."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:381
msgid ""
"Returns current widget's content. This was required inside widget A to return "
"widget A content when requested by widget B. The new method is to use @A.text "
"inside B instead of just @A if you just want the unaltered text."
msgstr ""
"हालको विजेटको सामाग्री फर्काउछ । विजेट B द्वारा अनुरोध गरेको बेलामा विजेट A "
"सामाग्री फर्काउन विजेट A भित्र यो आवश्यक हुन्थ्यो । यदि तपाईँले परिवर्तन "
"नगरिएको पाठ मात्र चाहेमा @A को मात्र साटोमा B भित्रपट्टी @A. प्रयोग गर्ने नयाँ "
"बिधि हो ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:383
msgid ""
"Returns selected text or text of current item. This is deprecated for <i>"
"@mywidget.selected</i>."
msgstr ""
"हालको वस्तुको चयन गरिएको पाठ वा पाठ फर्काउछ । यो<i>@mywidget.selected</i> "
"का लागि अनुचित हुन्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:385
msgid ""
"Does nothing. This is useful if you request a CheckBox or RadioButton to return "
"a value where a state, typically the unchecked state, has no value. The @null "
"prevents an error indicating it is empty."
msgstr ""
"केहि हुदैन । यदि तपाईँले मान नभएको स्थिति, बिशेषत: चेकबाट हटाइएको स्थिति, मा "
"जाँच बाकस वा रेडियो बटन फर्काउन अनुरोध गर्दा उपयोगि हुन्छ । @null ले यो खाली "
"भएको सूचीत गर्ने त्रुटि रोकथाम गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:387
msgid "Returns the pid (process ID) of the current process."
msgstr "हालको प्रक्रियाको pid (प्रक्रिया आईडी) फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:389
msgid ""
"Returns DCOP identifier of current process. This is shorthand for <i>"
"kmdr-executor-@pid</i>."
msgstr ""
"हालको प्रक्रियाको डीसीओपी पहिचायक फर्काउछ । यो<i>kmdr-executor-@pid</i> "
"का लागि संक्षेप हुन्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:392
msgid "Returns the pid of the parent Kommander window."
msgstr "प्रमूल आदेश सञ्झ्यालको pid फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:394
msgid "Writes <i>text</i> on stderr."
msgstr "stderr मा <i>पाठ</i> लेख्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:396
msgid "Writes <i>text</i> on standard output."
msgstr "मानक निर्गतमा <i>पाठ</i> लेख्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:398
msgid ""
"Executes a script block. Bash is used if no shell is given. It is primarily for "
"use in non-button widgets where script actions are not expected. Full path is "
"not required for the shell which may be useful for portability. "
"<p><i>If this is used inside a button it allows alternate script languages to "
"be used and will return a value to the main script, which may be unexpected.</i>"
msgstr ""
"स्क्रिप्ट खण्ड कार्यान्वयन गर्छ । शेल नदिदा ब्यास प्रयोग गरिन्छ । यो सामान्यतया "
"स्क्रिप्ट कार्यहरू अपेक्षा नगरिएका बटन नहुने विजेटका लागि प्रयोग गरिन्छ । शेलका "
"लागि पूरा मार्ग आवश्यक हुदैन जुन चलाउनका लागि उपयोगि हुन्छ । "
"<p><i> यदि यसलाई बटनको भित्रपट्टी प्रयोग गरिन्छ भने यसले प्रयोग हुने वैकल्पिक "
"स्क्रिप्ट भाषाहरूलाई अनुमति दिन्छ र मुख्य स्क्रिप्टमा मान फर्काउछ, जुन "
"अनपेक्षित हुनसक्छ ।</i>"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:400
msgid ""
"Returns value of an environment (shell) variable. Do not use <i>$</i> "
"in the name. For example, <i>@env(PATH)</i>."
msgstr ""
"परिवेश (शेल) चलको मान फर्काउछ । नाममा <i>$</i> प्रयोग नगर्नुहोस् ।उदाहरणका "
"लागि, <i>@env(PATH)</i> ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:402 plugin/specialinformation.cpp:404
msgid "Executes an external shell command."
msgstr "बाह्य शेल आदेश कार्यान्वयन गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:406
msgid "Parses an expression and returns computed value."
msgstr "अभिव्यक्ति पदवर्णन गर्छ र गणना गरिएको मान फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:408
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Executes loop: values from <i>items</i> list (passed as EOL-separated string) "
"are assigned to the variable. "
"<br><b>Old</b>"
"<br> <i>@forEach(i,A\\nB\\nC\\n)"
"<br>  @# @i=A"
"<br>@end</i>"
"<br><b>New</b>"
"<br><i>foreach i in MyArray do"
"<br>  //i = key, MyArray[i] = val"
"<br>end "
msgstr ""
"लूप कार्यान्वय गर्छ: <i>वस्तु</i> सूची (EOL-बिभाजित स्ट्रिङका रुपमा पास भएका) "
"मानहरू चलमा मानाङ्कन गरिन्छन् । "
"<br> <i>@forEach(i,A\\nB\\nC\\n)"
"<br>  @# @i=A"
"<br>@endif</i>"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:410
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Executes loop: variable is set to <i>start</i> and is increased by <i>step</i> "
"each time loop is executed. Execution stops when variable becomes larger then "
"<i>end</i>. "
"<br><b>Old</b>"
"<br><i>@for(i,1,10,1)"
"<br>  @# @i=1"
"<br>@endif</i>"
"<br><b>New</b>"
"<br><i>for i=0 to 20 step 5 do"
"<br>  debug(i)"
"<br>end</i>."
msgstr ""
"लूप कार्यान्वयन गर्छ: चल <i>सुरु</i> मा सेट हुन्छ र प्रत्येक पटक लूप "
"कार्यान्वयन भएको <i>चरण</i> मा बढाइन्छ । चल <i>अन्त्य</i> "
"भन्दा ठूलो भएपछि कार्यान्वयन रोकिन्छ । "
"<br><i>@for(i,1,10,1)"
"<br>  @# @i=1"
"<br>@endif</i>."

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:412
msgid "Returns the value of a global variable."
msgstr "विश्वब्यापी चलको मान फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:414
msgid ""
"Translates the string into the current language. Texts in GUI would be "
"automatically extracted for translation."
msgstr ""
"हालको भाषामा स्ट्रिङलाई अनुवाद गर्छ । अनुवादका लागि GUI का पाठ स्वत: झिकिन्छन् "
"।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:416
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Executes block if expression is true (non-zero number or non-empty string.) "
"<p><b>Old</b>Close with <b>@endif</b></p>"
"<p><b>New</b>"
"<br>if val == true then"
"<br>//  do op"
"<br>elseif cond"
"<br>//  second chance"
"<br>else"
"<br>//  cond failed"
"<br>endif</p>"
msgstr ""
"यदि अभिव्यक्ति ठीक भएमा खण्ड कार्यान्वयन गर्छ (शून्य-विहिन नम्बर वा खाली नभएको "
"स्ट्रिङ ।) "
"<p>यससँग बन्द गर्नुहोस् <b>@endif</b></p>"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:418
msgid ""
"Executes another Kommander dialog. Current dialog directory is used if no path "
"is given. Arguments may be given as named arguments which will become global "
"variables in the new dialog. For instance: <i>var=val</i>"
msgstr ""
"अन्य आदेश संवाद कार्यान्वयन गर्छ । यदि मार्ग दिएको नभएमा हालको संवाद डाइरेक्टरी "
"प्रयोग गरिन्छ । तर्कहरू नामकरण गरिएको तर्क अनुरुप दिइनस सक्छ जुन नयाँ संवादमा "
"बिश्वब्यापी चल हुन्छन् । दृष्टान्तका लागि: <i>var=val</i>"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:420
msgid "Reads setting from configration file for this dialog."
msgstr "यो संवादका लागि कन्फिगरेसन फाइलबाट सेटिङ पढ्दछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:422
msgid ""
"Sets the value of a global variable. Global variables exist for the life of the "
"Kommander window."
msgstr ""
"बिश्वब्यापी चलको मान सेट गर्दछ । बिश्वब्यापी चलहरू आदेश सञ्झ्यालका जीवनका "
"लागिअवस्थित हुन्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:424
msgid "Stores setting in configuration file for this dialog."
msgstr "यो संवादका लागि कन्फिगरेसन फाइलमा सेटिङ भण्डारण गर्दछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:426
msgid ""
"Begin of <b>switch</b> block. Following <b>case</b> values are compared to <i>"
"expression</i>."
"<p>@switch()"
"<br>@case()"
"<br>@end"
msgstr ""
"<b>स्विच</b> खण्डको सुरुआत । निम्न <b>केस</b> मानहरू <i>अभिव्यक्ति</i> "
"सँग तुलना गरिन्छन् ।"
"<p>@switch()"
"<br>@case()"
"<br>@end"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:428
msgid "Executes an external DCOP call."
msgstr "बाह्य डीसीओपी कल कार्यान्वयन गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:430
msgid "Adds a comment to EOL that Kommander will not parse"
msgstr "आदेशकले पदवर्णन नगर्ने ईओएलमा टिप्पणी थप्दछ"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:432
msgid ""
"Creates a new widget with the specified type and as the child of parent."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:434
msgid ""
"Returns true if there is a widget with the passed name, false otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:436
msgid "Connects the signal of sender with the slot of the receiver"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:438
#, fuzzy
msgid "Disconnects the signal of sender from the slot of the receiver"
msgstr "प्रेषक र प्रापक बीचमा जडान प्रदर्शन गर्दछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:441
msgid "Exits script execution and returns"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:443
msgid "Exits the current block of a while, for or foreach loop"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:445
msgid "Exit a step and return to the beginning of a loop"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:447
msgid ""
"Return from a script, optionaly with a value from the script to the caller"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:451
msgid "Returns an EOL-separated list of all values in the array."
msgstr "बाँणमा सबै मानहरूको एउटा ईओएलद्वारा-बिभाजीत सूची फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:453
msgid "Returns an EOL-separated list of all keys in the array."
msgstr "बाँणमा सबै कुञ्जीहरूको ईओएल-बिभाजीत सूची फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:455
msgid "Removes all elements from the array."
msgstr "बाँणबाट सबै तत्व हटाउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:457
msgid "Returns the number of elements in the array."
msgstr "बाँणमा तत्वहरूको नम्बर फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:459
msgid "Returns the value associated with the given key."
msgstr "दिएको कुञ्जीसँग सम्बन्धित मान फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:461
msgid "Removes element with the given key from the array."
msgstr "बाँणबाट दिएको कुञ्जीसँग तत्व हटाउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:463
msgid "Adds element with the given key and value to the array"
msgstr "बाँणमा दिएको कुञ्जी र मानसँग तत्व थप्दछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:465
msgid ""
"Adds all elements in the string to the array. String should have <i>"
"key\\tvalue\\n</i> format."
msgstr ""
"बाँणमा स्ट्रिङका सबै तत्व थप्दछ । स्ट्रिङ <i>key\\tvalue\\n</i> "
"ढाँचामा हुनुपर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:468
msgid ""
"Returns all elements in the array in "
"<pre>key\\tvalue\\n</pre> format."
msgstr ""
"बाँणमा "
"<pre>key\\tvalue\\n</pre> ढाँचाका सबै तत्वहरू फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:470
msgid ""
"Create an integer indexed array - starting from 0 - from a string. Use the "
"separator character to split the string. The separator's default value is "
"'\\t'."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:472
msgid ""
"Create a string from an integer indexed array. Concatenate the elements with "
"the separator character. The separator's default value is '\\t'."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:474
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Remove keyNum elements starting with keyStart from an indexed array and reindex "
"the array. If keyNum is not specified, remove only the keyStart element."
msgstr "बाँणबाट दिएको कुञ्जीसँगको तत्व हटाउनुहोस् ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:476
msgid ""
"Insert the elements from string starting at key and reindex the array. Use the "
"separator to separate the elements from the string. The separator's default "
"value is '\\t'."
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:481
msgid "Returns number of chars in the string."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङमा क्यारेक्टरहरूको नम्बर फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:483
msgid "Checks if the the string contains the given substring."
msgstr "यदि स्ट्रिङमा दिएको सब-स्ट्रिङ भएमा जाँच गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:485
msgid ""
"Returns the position of a substring in the string, or -1 if it is not found."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङमा सब- स्ट्रिङको स्थिति फर्काउछ, वा यो फेला नपरेमा -१ फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:487
msgid ""
"Returns the position of a substring in the string, or -1 if it is not found. "
"String is searched backwards"
msgstr ""
"स्ट्रिङमा सब-स्ट्रिङको स्थिति फर्काउछ, वा यो फेला नपरेमा -१ फर्काउछ । स्ट्रिङ "
"पछिल्तिर खोजिन्छन् ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:489
msgid "Returns the first <i>n</i> chars of the string."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङको पहिला <i>n</i> क्यारेक्टर फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:491
msgid "Returns the last <i>n</i> chars of the string."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङको अन्तिम <i>n</i> क्यारेक्टर फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:493
msgid "Returns <i>n</i> chars of the string, starting from <i>start</i>."
msgstr "<i>पहिलो</i> बाट सुरु हुने, स्ट्रिङका क्यारेक्टर <i>n</i> फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:495
msgid "Removes all occurrences of given substring."
msgstr "दिएका सब-स्ट्रिङका सबै घटना हटाउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:497
msgid ""
"Replaces all occurrences of the given substring with the given replacement."
msgstr "दिएको प्रतिस्थापनसँग दिएको सब-स्ट्रिङको घटना बदल्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:499
msgid "Converts the string to uppercase."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङलाई ठूलो अक्षरमा रुपान्तरण गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:501
msgid "Converts the string to lowercase."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङलाई सानो अक्षरमा रुपान्तरण गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:503
msgid ""
"Compares two strings. Returns 0 if they are equal, -1 if the first one is "
"lower, 1 if the first one is higher"
msgstr ""
"दुई स्ट्रिङ तुलना गर्छ । यदि बराबर भएमा ०, पहिलो सानो भएमा -१, पहिलो ठूलो भएमा "
"१ फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:506
msgid "Checks if the string is empty."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङ खाली भएको जाँच गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:508
msgid "Checks if the string is a valid number."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङ बैध नम्बर भएमा जाँच गर्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:510
msgid "Returns given section of a string."
msgstr "स्ट्रिङको दिएको खण्ड फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:512
msgid ""
"Returns the given string with %1, %2, %3 replaced with <i>arg1</i>, <i>arg2</i>"
", <i>arg3</i> accordingly."
msgstr ""
"दिएको स्ट्रिङ <i>arg1</i>, <i>arg2</i>, <i>arg3</i> अनुसार %1, %2, %3 मा "
"फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:515
msgid "Convert a string to an integer. If not possible use the default value"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:517
msgid ""
"Convert a string to a double precision floating point value. If not possible "
"use the default value"
msgstr ""

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:521
msgid "Returns content of given file."
msgstr "दिएको फाइलको सामाग्री फर्काउछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:523
msgid "Writes given string to a file."
msgstr "दिएको स्ट्रिङ फाइलमा लेख्छ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:525
msgid "Appends given string to the end of a file."
msgstr "फाइलको अन्त्यमा दिएको स्ट्रिङ थप्दछ ।"

#: plugin/specialinformation.cpp:528
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Shows color dialog. Returns color in #RRGGBB format. Defaults to the parameter, "
